## Solution to Grade

---
title: "Experimentation (A/B) Platform"
category: "AI/ML Infrastructure"
difficulty: "Hard"
tags: ["experimentation", "ab-testing", "metrics", "analytics", "statistics", "data-quality", "governance"]
